meta {
  name: Create Analytics Report
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/analytics-reports
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "siteId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "enabled": true,
    "cron": "0 9 * * 2",
    "lookback": "last_week",
    "channelIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
  }
}

docs {
  Creates an analytics report for one of the client's sites, sent to the
  given channels, in one transaction (SOL-52).
    cron: 5 fields, read in the client's timezone ("0 9 * * 2" = Tuesdays 9am)
    lookback: last_week | last_month | last_7_days | last_28_days
    enabled: default true; channelIds: default []

  siteId and channelIds must be this client's. 201 responds with the same
  shape as Get Analytics Report (and the report appears in the scheduler's
  List Analytics Reports). 422 VALIDATION_ERROR with details.siteId /
  details.channelIds naming ids that aren't this client's.
}
